.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmouser model add\fR [\fB\-\-api\fR] [\fB\-\-url\fR] [\fB\-\-key\-stdin\fR] [\fB\-\-model\fR] [\fB\-\-ca\fR] [\fB\-\-desktop\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fINAME\fR> 
