.SH DESCRIPTION
Add or update: `add openai \-\-key\-stdin`, `add grok \-\-key\-stdin` (grok_… or xai\-… key) or `add grok \-\-desktop`, or `add NAME \-\-api openai|anthropic|google \-\-url URL [\-\-model M]…`. Without \-\-model it lists the provider\*(Aqs models and asks
