.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-api\fR \fI<API>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-url\fR \fI<URL>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-key\-stdin\fR
Read the API key from stdin (stored in the OS keychain, never in preferences)
.TP
\fB\-\-model\fR \fI<MODELS>\fR
Models it offers, first is its default (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-\-ca\fR \fI<CA>\fR
PEM certificate/CA to trust for an https URL
.TP
\fB\-\-desktop\fR
grok only: use the signed\-in Grok Bot desktop app\*(Aqs login (opt\-in; no key)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
